{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "header",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 收敛与极限定理 · 学习总图\n\n先辨认极限是在路径、均方误差、偏离概率还是分布上成立，再读定理给出的具体结论。这里把收敛方式、它们之间的蕴含和产生这些极限的定理分成独立节点。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 1860,
      "height": 180
    },
    {
      "id": "mean-square-implication",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[均方收敛推出概率收敛|Mean-square to probability]]\n\nMarkov bounds each fixed-tolerance error probability by $E[(X_n-X)^2]/\\varepsilon^2$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n用平均平方误差控制固定阈值的超差概率；反向会被罕见大误差破坏。",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "almost-sure-implication",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[几乎必然收敛推出概率收敛|Almost sure to probability]]\n\nOn almost every path, errors beyond a fixed tolerance eventually stop; the tail-event probabilities vanish.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n几乎每条路径的固定阈值超差最终停止，因而剩余尾事件的概率趋零。",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "almost-sure",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[几乎必然收敛|Almost sure convergence]]\n\nOn one probability-one event, each path approaches its target on that same outcome. The cutoff may depend on the path.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n在同一个概率为一的事件上，各路径趋近同一结果下的目标；起始时刻可因路径而异。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "mean-square",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[均方收敛|Mean-square convergence]]\n\nFor square-integrable variables on one space, $E[(X_n-X)^2]\\to0$. Rare large errors still matter.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同一空间内各变量平方可积，平均平方误差趋零；罕见大误差仍有影响。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "in-probability",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[依概率收敛|Convergence in probability]]\n\nFor every fixed $\\varepsilon>0$, $P(\\lvert X_n-X\\rvert>\\varepsilon)\\to0$. Compare values on the same outcome.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n对每个固定正容忍值，超差概率趋零；比较同一个结果下的取值。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "in-distribution",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[依分布收敛|Convergence in distribution]]\n\nCDFs approach the limiting CDF at each of its continuity points. Only the laws are compared.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nCDF 在极限 CDF 的每个连续点收敛；这里只比较概率律。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "implications",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[概率收敛推出分布收敛|Probability to distribution]]\n\nA fixed margin sandwiches the CDFs at continuity points of the limiting CDF.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先固定误差余量，再在极限CDF的连续点夹逼；极限可以随机。",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "distribution-no-probability",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[分布收敛不推概率收敛|Laws do not fix a pairing]]\n\n$X_n=1-X$ and a fair Bernoulli $X$ have the same law but always differ by one.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n公平Bernoulli变量与其互补值分布相同，但指定配对始终相差一。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "constant-limit-converse",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[常数分布极限推出概率收敛|A constant limiting value]]\n\nIf $X_n\\Rightarrow c$, both tails outside a fixed neighbourhood of $c$ vanish, giving $X_n\\xrightarrow p c$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n常数极限下，两侧尾概率趋零，恢复依概率收敛。",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "continuous-mapping",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[连续映射定理]]\n\n只要极限变量以概率 1 避开函数的不连续点，连续变换保持 a.s.、p 与 d 三种方式。",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "strong-law",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[强大数定律|Strong law of large numbers]]\n\nFor iid integrable real inputs, the sample mean converges almost surely to their common mean.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同一概率一事件上的整条路径收敛；不要求方差有限。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "weak-law",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[弱大数定律|Weak law of large numbers]]\n\nThe sample mean approaches a target mean in probability: every fixed-tolerance error probability tends to zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n这是依概率收敛的结论；具体定理另给保证它成立的条件。",
      "x": 420,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bounded-variance-weak-law",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[有界方差弱大数定律|Bounded-variance weak law]]\n\nPairwise uncorrelated inputs, a common mean and one finite variance bound give mean-square, hence probability, convergence.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n两两独立已足够，但不相关就能完成方差证明。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "clt",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[经典中心极限定理]]\n\n中心化、标准化后的样本均值依分布收敛到标准正态。",
      "x": 1180,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "slutsky",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## [[Slutsky定理]]\n\n把依概率收敛到常数的一致估计量，安全地代入已有的分布极限。",
      "x": 1560,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "footer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "颜色只区分本图中的语义角色：绿色是定义入口，紫色是定理，橙色是关系辨析。箭头指向逻辑后果、定理结论采用的收敛方式或直接推论；它不表示两条极限定理的假设彼此包含。",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1750,
      "width": 1860,
      "height": 170
    },
    {
      "id": "p0012-portmanteau",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Portmanteau定理|Portmanteau theorem]]\n\nFixed closed sets give upper-limit bounds; sets with zero limiting boundary mass have converging probabilities.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定闭集给出上极限界；极限分布在集合边界无质量时，事件概率收敛。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0013-l1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2070,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[L1收敛|Convergence in L1]]\n\nMean absolute error tends to zero; Markov then controls every fixed-tolerance error probability.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n逐个结果比较后平均绝对误差，进而得到依概率收敛。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0013-ui",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 2070,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 250,
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[一致可积与L1收敛|The uniform-integrability criterion]]\n\nConvergence in probability plus UI is exactly what upgrades to L1 convergence with an integrable limit.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nUI统一控制罕见大值的贡献，补足依概率收敛缺少的尾部条件。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0014-expect-cs",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[期望的Cauchy–Schwarz不等式|Cauchy–Schwarz for expectations]]\n\nFor square-integrable errors, $E|Z|\\le\\sqrt{E[Z^2]}$; dependence is allowed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n有限二阶矩控制平均绝对大小；无需独立。",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 2070,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 250
    },
    {
      "id": "p0014-mct",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[单调收敛定理|Monotone convergence]]\n\nIf $0\\le X_n\\uparrow X$ almost surely, then $E[X_n]\\uparrow E[X]$; $+\\infty$ is allowed.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非负递增序列可以把极限移入期望，允许结果无穷大。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2450,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 290
    },
    {
      "id": "p0014-fatou",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Fatou引理|Fatou's lemma]]\n\nFor nonnegative variables, $E[\\liminf X_n]\\le\\liminf E[X_n]$. Equality need not hold.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n非负条件给出下界方向；逃向罕见大值的质量可能使不等式严格。",
      "x": 680,
      "y": 2450,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 290
    },
    {
      "id": "p0014-dct",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[控制收敛定理|Dominated convergence]]\n\nAlmost-sure convergence and one integrable envelope $|X_n|\\le Y$ give L1 convergence and convergence of expectations.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n几乎必然收敛加上同一个可积包络，可控制极限中的平均绝对误差。",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 2450,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 290
    }
  ],
